---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms • RouteVault">
  <Nav active="/terms" />
  <main class="rv-wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Terms</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="lede">The plain terms for using routevault.ai. Last updated October 2026.</p>

    <section class="card" style="padding:1.1rem;max-width:760px">
      <h2>Service</h2>
      <p>RouteVault is provided as-is. Prices and scores change constantly; we refresh them several times a day but do not guarantee accuracy at any moment. Verify with the provider before you spend real money.</p>

      <h2>Accounts</h2>
      <p>You're responsible for your account. We may suspend accounts that abuse the service (scraping at scale, hammering the API, or injecting junk through forms).</p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>The site, its copy, and its scoring rubric belong to Veanox. Provider names and model names belong to their owners. You're welcome to link to any page here.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:hello@routevault.ai">hello@routevault.ai</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
